name: Erratic Queen Spike — many Queens
author: corpus
description: >-
  Erratic Deck starting deck with at least 13 Queens, a 25% face-card rank spike for
  Shoot the Moon, Triboulet, Photograph, and Strength-to-King pivots. RAG aliases: erratic queens,
  many Queens, face-card pile, Baron prep, PhotoChad setup.
deck: Erratic
stake: White
must:
  - erraticRank: Queen
    min: 13
should:
  - joker: ShootTheMoon
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 55
  - joker: Triboulet
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - tarotCard: Strength
    label: "Queens can become Kings for Baron lines"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Photograph
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
